e... No, I'm not gonna send anything, he probably doesn't even remember me. What if the other side thinks the same?<br><br>Friends we still remember, but never met face to face. Hundreds, for some thousands, of hours with people who one day might just have their last match together, their last raid, without even knowing it. &quot;GG see you tomorrow&quot;, last seen online 10 years ago.<br>Where is everyone, and how are they doing? Do they remember? Convento is a love letter not just to videogames, but to the gaming community as a whole.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816590/extras/44f3eb2375094441fb30a4eeed31a85b.avif?t=1725634849\" width=633 height=318 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816590/extras/d10627ef0db3243bcc870d151994c839.avif?t=1725634849\" width=640 height=318 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816590/extras/753bf945c7d2fba00a03c1b67ad37f57.avif?t=1725634849\" width=724 height=378 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816590/extras/6741644d463c22a78fad49132f768f02.avif?t=1725634849\" width=633 height=318 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2816590/extras/bc44cfde64051944dceee6b014794caa.avif?t=1725634849\" width=633 height=318 /></span>",
